# No client-side environment variables are required.
# The AI endpoint lives at api/ai/chat.ts (Vercel Edge Function) and is
# reached via /ai/chat (rewritten by vercel.json).
#
# LOCAL DEV: put your DeepSeek key in .env.local at repo root (gitignored):
#
#     DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here
#
# PRODUCTION: Vercel dashboard → your project → Settings →
#   Environment Variables → Production → add DEEPSEEK_API_KEY.
